Copyright (c) Autonomous AI, licensed under the MIT License.

The following files are adapted from that repository and retain their
upstream design, comments and test vectors (see the attribution headers in
each file):

  firmware/main/cable_frame.c, firmware/main/cable_frame.h   (near-verbatim)
  firmware/main/cable_link.c, firmware/main/cable_link.h     (adapted)
  firmware/main/cable_client.c, firmware/main/cable_client.h (derived, trimmed
                                                             to the C3 scope)
  firmware/test/vectors/cable_frame.txt                      (verbatim)
  firmware/scripts/gen_cable_vectors.py                      (verbatim)
  PROTOCOL.md                                                (extracted spec)

